surgery-error-self = You can't operate on yourself.
surgery-error-wrong-tool = The current step needs a different tool.

surgery-clean-self = You wash the dirt off your hands.
surgery-clean-other = You wash the dirt off.

surgery-complication-infection = Infection
surgery-complication-infection-message = The wound is infected: dirt got inside.
surgery-complication-infection-patient = The wound burns and throbs.
surgery-complication-bleeding = Bleeding
surgery-complication-bleeding-message = The vessels aren't clamped — the patient is bleeding out.
surgery-complication-bleeding-patient = You feel blood leaving the wound.
surgery-complication-jerk = The patient jerked
surgery-complication-jerk-message = The patient jerked under the instrument!
surgery-complication-jerk-patient = You jerked from the pain!
surgery-complication-contamination = Contamination
surgery-complication-contamination-message = Hands and instrument are filthy.

surgery-step-incision-start = You cut into the flesh.
surgery-step-incision-success = The incision is made.
surgery-step-incision-crude = You hack the flesh open.
surgery-step-resin-start = You chop into the resinous flesh.
surgery-step-resin-chop = The resin gave way to the axe, but the edge is ragged.
surgery-step-resin-success = The resin is cut cleanly.
surgery-step-bone-start = You bite into the bone.
surgery-step-bone-success = The bone is opened.
surgery-step-retract-start = You pull the incision open.
surgery-step-retract-success = The incision is held open with a retractor.
surgery-step-retract-crude = You pry the edges apart with whatever you have.
surgery-step-clamp-start = You clamp the vessels.
surgery-step-clamp-success = The bleeding is stopped.
surgery-step-cauterize-start = You cauterize the incision.
surgery-step-cauterize-success = The incision is cauterized.
surgery-step-resin-seal-start = You press your hands against the resin.
surgery-step-resin-seal-success = The incision closes over with resin.

surgery-opening = Opening
surgery-opening-desc = Cut and open the cavity.
surgery-closing = Closing
surgery-closing-desc = Stop the bleeding and close the wound.
surgery-diona-resin-seal = Resin sealing
surgery-diona-resin-seal-desc = Cut the resinous flesh and let it close over naturally.
